2976	+## Intent
2977	+
2978	+**Problem:** `ApiClient._mapDioException` already maps any mid-session `AUTH_EXPIRED` response to `Failure.authExpired` (`api_client.dart:95-111`), but nothing reacts to it — `SessionStatus` only ever emits from the boot-time `restoreSession()` call (`session_repository_impl.dart:81-136`), so an expired session mid-use today surfaces only as a raw inline error on whatever screen made the call, and the user is never routed back to re-auth.
2979	+
2980	+**Approach:** Add a core `SessionExpiryNotifier` port (in the already-scaffolded empty `lib/core/session/`) that `ApiClient` signals on any non-boot `AUTH_EXPIRED`; `SessionRepositoryImpl` bridges that into one new `SessionStatus.expired` value on the epic's existing single stream. `main.dart` keeps rendering the same authenticated screen across that transition and shows a new shared `ConfirmationDialog` overlay (neutral title) whose "Entrar novamente" button routes to a throwaway re-auth placeholder standing in for Epic 2's biometric/PIN flow.
2981	+
2982	+## Boundaries & Constraints
2983	+
2984	+**Always:**
2985	+- `ApiClient` notifies expiry only for `AUTH_EXPIRED` on calls outside `HeaderInterceptor.anonKeyOnlyFunctions` (`header_interceptor.dart:20-24`, matched via its `functionNameOf`) — boot-time `auth-refresh` keeps going through Story 1.4's existing `restoreSession()` path untouched.
2986	+- `SessionStatus` gains exactly one new `expired` value; `statusStream`/`restoreSession`/`dispose` signatures are unchanged — still the epic's one singleton stream (AD), no second stream.
2987	+- `SessionRepositoryImpl` emits `expired` only when `_lastStatus == SessionStatus.authenticated`; any other current status ignores the event (no spurious overlay during boot or after logout).
2988	+- Overlay = new `ConfirmationDialog` (`lib/core/widgets/`): neutral `colorTextPrimary` title (never `colorError`), non-dismissible barrier, focus-trapped, at most one open at a time (UX-DR16/25/27/36). Entrance is exactly `scrimIn` (0.18s ease-out fade) — the system's only other animation, `sheetUp`, is untouched.
2989	+- The authenticated screen's widget instance is never replaced across `authenticated`↔`expired` transitions — scroll/state preserved; the `AuthScreen` branch is unaffected.
2990	+- Copy never implies data loss; must state history/scroll position are preserved (mirrors the prototype's own "Sessão expirada" copy).
2991	+
2992	+**Ask First:** if a future consumer needs a session state beyond this story's single new `expired` value, HALT before adding a fourth `SessionStatus` member — renegotiate the epic's AD first.
2993	+
2994	+**Never:**
2995	+- No `go_router` — `main.dart` keeps its current `MaterialApp`/`Navigator` shape (Story 1.6).
2996	+- No Epic 2 biometric/PIN implementation — "Entrar novamente" only navigates to a throwaway placeholder that Epic 2 deletes wholesale.
2997	+- No new icon-font dependency — approximate the prototype's `ph-lock-key` with a built-in Material icon.
2998	+- No Reduce-Motion handling — out of this epic's scope.
2999	+
3000	+## I/O & Edge-Case Matrix
3001	+
3002	+| Scenario | Input / State | Expected Output / Behavior | Error Handling |
3003	+|----------|--------------|---------------------------|----------------|
3004	+| Mid-session expiry | authenticated, any screen, any endpoint returns `AUTH_EXPIRED` | overlay appears over the current screen; its scroll/state is preserved | silent — no extra inline error |
3005	+| Already-open overlay | a second `AUTH_EXPIRED` arrives while the dialog is showing | no second dialog stacks | silent, single-overlay guard holds |
3006	+| Expiry while not authenticated | notifier fires but `_lastStatus != authenticated` (e.g. post-logout race) | no emission, no overlay | silent no-op |
3007	+| Boot-time refresh expiry | `restoreSession()`'s own `auth-refresh` call returns `AUTH_EXPIRED` | unchanged Story 1.4 behavior — lands on `AuthScreen`, never the overlay | existing path, untouched |
3008	+| "Entrar novamente" tapped | overlay visible | dialog dismissed, user routed to the biometric/PIN placeholder | N/A |
3009	+
3010	+</frozen-after-approval>
